        <p class="adt-body italic leading-relaxed"><span data-id="pg117_n0011">Pylli &#xeb;sht&#xeb; bashk&#xeb;si e gjall&#xeb; e pem&#xeb;ve dhe e shkurreve.</span> <span data-id="pg117_n0012">Pylli konsiderohet si nj&#xeb; fabrik&#xeb; ekologjike e p&#xeb;rsosur, sepse pastron ajrin, por &#xeb;sht&#xeb; edhe nj&#xeb; vend ideal p&#xeb;r jet&#xeb;n e shum&#xeb; kafsh&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; egra dhe nj&#xeb;her&#xeb;sh njeriu p&#xeb;rfiton nga ai.</span></p>
        <p class="adt-body italic leading-relaxed mt-4"><span data-id="pg117_n0014">Duke e ditur dobin&#xeb; e drur&#xeb;ve p&#xeb;r jet&#xeb;n n&#xeb; Tok&#xeb;, njeriu duhet t&#xeb; ket&#xeb; kujdes q&#xeb; t&#xeb; mos i pres&#xeb; drur&#xeb;t dhe t&#xeb; mos i shkat&#xeb;rroj&#xeb; pyjet.</span> <span data-id="pg117_n0015">Njer&#xeb;zit me veprimet e tyre t&#xeb; pap&#xeb;rgjegjshme presin pyjet p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; b&#xeb;r&#xeb; rrug&#xeb;, vendbanime, si dhe p&#xeb;r shum&#xeb; nevoja t&#xeb; tjera personale.</span></p>
        <p class="adt-body italic leading-relaxed mt-4"><span data-id="pg117_n0017">Gjat&#xeb; stin&#xeb;s s&#xeb; ver&#xeb;s, ekziston rreziku i zjarreve n&#xeb; pyje, p&#xeb;r shkak t&#xeb; temperaturave t&#xeb; larta.</span> <span data-id="pg117_n0018">Pyjet priten ose digjen, por ne duhet t&#xeb; kujdesemi q&#xeb; ato t&#xeb; rip&#xeb;rt&#xeb;rihen.</span></p>
        <p class="adt-body italic leading-relaxed mt-4"><span data-id="pg117_n0020">Ne duhet t&#xeb; jemi t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rgjegjsh&#xeb;m q&#xeb; gjithmon&#xeb; t&#xeb; mbjellim sa m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; drur&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg117_n0021">P&#xeb;r &#xe7;do pyll duhet t&#xeb; kujdeset pylltari, gjithashtu p&#xeb;r &#xe7;do prerje druri duhet t&#xeb; k&#xeb;rkohet leje nga institucionet p&#xeb;rkat&#xeb;se.</span></p>
